null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-07-17T18:22:02Z","updated_at":"2026-07-25T18:38:04Z","closed_at":"2026-07-21T17:30:12Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121509","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121509","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121509.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121509.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-21T17:30:12Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nTo check if an autoload was freed, it currently checks for `scene_file_path` by using [`Node::is_instance()`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/c12e51972a41665743be79c7d3e3fd5c871d97f3/scene/main/node.h#L874), and not if it was actually freed or not. I fixed it by check if the node is inside the tree, as a freed node cannot be inside the tree anyways, this is also the way it's done in [other places](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/c12e51972a41665743be79c7d3e3fd5c871d97f3/editor/scene/2d/scene_paint_2d_editor_plugin.cpp#L242).\r\n\r\nSomehow (I still don't know how) this can cause a crash, with a seemingly corrupted RID, like in PhantomCamera. PhantomCamera seems to do weird stuff regarding their singleton registration, which can cause the crash. The actual error can be seen in [this issue](https://github.com/ramokz/phantom-camera/issues/665). How the crash actually happens is a mistery to me, I just know that this fixes it.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n- No AI used.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":